    "chunk_text": "ahtateo\u00fean geare his rices, \u00fea Crist w\u00e6s ahangen, wear\u00f0 micel \u00feeosternes ofer eallne \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Romane acwealdon Tiberius mid attre. He h\u00e6fde rice XXIII wintra. \u00c6fter \u00f0\u00e6m \u00fee Romeburg getimbred w\u00e6s VII hunde wintra & LXXXX, wear\u00fe Gaius Gallica He w\u00e6s swi\u00fee gefylled mid un\u00feeawum & mid firenlustum, & ealle he w\u00e6s swelce Romane \u00fea Ac he hit on him swi\u00fee wr\u00e6c, & hi him swa la\u00f0e w\u00e6ron \u00fe\u00e6t he oft wyscte \u00fe\u00e6t ealle Romane & he self for oft on o\u00fera lond, & wolde gewin findan, ac he ne mehte buton sibbe. Ungelice w\u00e6ron \u00fea tida, cw\u00e6\u00f0 Orosius, si\u00fe\u00fean Crist geboren w\u00e6s, si\u00fe\u00fean mon ne mehte unsibbe On \u00fe\u00e6m dagum com eac Godes wracu ofer Iu\u00fean, \u00fe\u00e6t hie \u00e6g\u00feer h\u00e6fdon unge\u00few\u00e6rnesse ge & hie Gaius het ut adrifan. \u00dea sendon hie Filonem hiora \u00feone gel\u00e6redestan mon to \u00feon \u00fe\u00e6t he him sceolde Gaiuses mildse Ac he hie for \u00fe\u00e6re gewilnunga swi\u00fee bismrade, & bebead \u00fe\u00e6t hie mon on \u00e6lce healfe hiende \u00fe\u00e6r & Pilatus he h\u00e6fde on \u00fereatunge o\u00fe he hiene selfne ofstong: he ged\u00e6mde urne Dryhten to dea\u00f0e. Ra\u00fee \u00fe\u00e6s Romane ofslogon Gaius sl\u00e6pendne. \u00dea funde mon on his ma\u00f0mhuse twa cista, \u00fea w\u00e6ron attres fulle. & on o\u00feerre",
